sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Chat service
    participant SQL as Relational store
    participant Obj as Object storage
    participant Vec as Vector store
    participant Ca as Cache
    App->>SQL: users, conversations, turn metadata
    Note over SQL: small rows, transactional, queried by user — a relational job
    App->>Obj: attachments and large artifacts
    Note over Obj: never put a 30 MB file in the database
    App->>Vec: embeddings for retrieval
    Vec-->>App: nearest neighbours by cosine distance
    App->>Ca: hot conversation context
    Ca-->>App: avoids re-reading the whole thread per turn
    Note over App,Ca: four stores because four access patterns — not because four is fashionable
